data/

# A GitHub token, if one is ever saved here while using tools/upload.mjs.
#
# This is a backstop, not the plan: tools/upload.mjs reads the token from a path
# you choose and never from the command line, so it should never land in the
# repository. It is here because a public repo is exactly where a leaked token
# must never be, and the cost of forgetting is very high while the cost of this
# line is zero.
token.txt
tokens.txt
*.token
github_pat_*
ghp_*
